DESCRIPTION:The 17th Open City Documentary Festival takes place at venues a
 cross London in April 2027\, presenting international contemporary and ret
 rospective non-fiction film\, audio and cross-media work alongside filmmak
 er Q&As\, panels\, talks and workshops.\n\nOrganisation: Open City Documen
 tary Festival / UCL\nLocation: London\, UK\nAward: Screening fees for all 
 selected works: GBP 275 for works over 60 min\, GBP 140 for works over 40 
 min\, GBP 70 for works under 40 min\, GBP 100 for cross-platform projects 
 (all incl. VAT)\nDuration: Festival runs 9-18 April 2027 at venues across 
